しい点か問題点があれば、お気になさらずこの依頼をキャンセルしてください。ご検討のほど、何卒よろしくお願いします。\n\nhttps://www.deviantart.com/stash/2ltf9xeooyt", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 406341, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "まーち@創作垢", "screen_name": "march", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1309571587788517376/RCbjl_1c.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/2906693946/1542774370/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 10, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 145}, {"id": 3161701, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "ぱる_雑多垢　別名:ゆい 少し低浮上になります", "screen_name": "ruijack1", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1918884471002288128/kdCgdwgy.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1400361232360624129/1744812425/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "correction"}], "banned": false, "nc": 144}, {"id": 3296331, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "奈倉える@skeb募集中", "screen_name": "L_L_L_77", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1982164793596186624/Qxo1fEq2.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1654444089067319299/1718009178/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills"